Without an artifact, I'd go for a crysknife :) Slightly less damage 
than a unihorn, but single handed and with a larger to-hit bonus. 
Furthermore knife skill will not start from unskilled. Worms don't 
appear until ( ( dlevel + xplevel ) / 2 = 9 ) though, and of course you 
need ?oEW for creating and fixing. A silver sabre is also worth 
considering, but a healer can only get to basic skill, which may be a 
problem pre Quest.

If you're lucky enough to find some, shuriken are the Healer's best 
ranged weapon. I always find loads in Gehennom, which is a little too 
late. Make sure they're blessed and you have decent luck to avoid them 
vanishing. Also remember that you can poison them, unlike daggers. 
Otherwise use daggers, preferably elven.


